\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Saviour, Prince of Israel's race,
\par See me from thy lofty throne,
\par Give the sweet relenting grace,
\par Soften this obdurate stone;
\par Stone to flesh, O God, convert;
\par Cast a look, and break my heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. By Thy Spirit, Lord, reprove,
\par All my inmost sins reveal,
\par Sins against Thy light and love
\par Let me see, and let me feel;
\par Sins that crucified my God,
\par Spilt again Thy precious blood.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesu, seek Thy wandering sheep,
\par Make me restless to return;
\par Bid me look on Thee and weep,
\par Bitterly as Peter mourn,
\par Till I say, by grace restored,
\par Now Thou know'st I love Thee, Lord!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Might I in Thy sight appear
\par As the publican distressed,
\par Stand, not daring to draw near,
\par Smite on my unworthy breast,
\par Groan the sinner's only plea:
\par God, be merciful to me!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. O remember me for good,
\par Passing through the mortal vale;
\par Show me the atoning blood,
\par When my strength and spirit fail;
\par Give my gasping soul to see
\par Jesus crucified for me!
\par                            Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

